  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Spring (Among the Living)** (1 other source): About ten seconds were removed around the 2:20 mark because of a brief conversation, with the remainder crossfaded [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **4th of July**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Louie Louie**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2024-07-04.flac16.at943.engsky** (recommended): source not stated; 12 songs; 81 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Listener says quiet passages clearly pick up loud chewing or teeth-related crowd noise near the taper [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2024-07-04.flac16.at943.engsky**: taped by EnglishSkylarking; source: AT943/CMC-8 > 12v BB > SP-ATEN-1 > SP-SAPM-1-USB-C > Moto X4 [1]. Also: Recorded with Audio-Technica AT943 mics and Sound Professionals SP-CMC-8 (4.7k mod) into a Motorola Moto X4 phone; Captured as 24-bit/48kHz WAV, then processed in iZotope RX11 and Sound Forge Pro, finally dithered to 16-bit/44.1kHz FLAC [1]",
